# chthonia's menu (plan §41.11a): a beginner's subset of the one command
# vocabulary, in the format of profiles/default.menu, laid out as Thonny's
# menus are (its rows for the commands madcide has; step 3e). No Build,
# Project or Views rows: the power surface is not advertised. View ▸
# Variables joins as its command lands; View ▸ Outline shows the outline in
# the sidebar beside Variables (chthonia.layout). Thonny rows whose command
# madcide does not have yet: File ▸ Close, Close all, Save All; View ▸ the
# font size, Full screen.

File new New
File editfile Open…
File save Save [editable]
File saveas Save As… [editable]
File -
File quit Quit

Edit undo Undo [editable && !viewing]
Edit redo Redo [editable && !viewing]
Edit -
Edit cut Cut [selection && editable]
Edit copy Copy [selection]
Edit paste Paste [editable]
Edit -
Edit selectall Select all
Edit -
Edit indent Indent selected lines [editable]
Edit dedent Dedent selected lines [editable]
Edit togglecomment Toggle comment [editable]
Edit -
Edit find Find…
Edit replace Replace… [editable]
Edit gotoline Go to line…
Edit -
Edit replclear Clear shell

Run replrun Run
Run replstop Stop
Run language Language…

View repl Shell
View variables Variables
View problems Problems
View outline Outline

Tools keystyle Key bindings…
Tools options Options…

Help help Help
Help about About Chthonia

# The toolbar (the placement word `toolbar`, plan §41.11a): its buttons, each
# with its picture — {ICON [MENU]}, ui::icon's vocabulary and the menu its
# arrow drops down (the mockup's Run ▾). Debug, the steps and the
# breakpoints join with the debugger.
toolbar new {new} New
toolbar editfile {open} Open
toolbar save {save} Save [editable]
toolbar -
toolbar replrun {run Run} Run
toolbar replstop {stop} Stop
